# Only hand-edited files belong in version control (source, scripts, docs, manuscript).
# Computed outputs and binaries are excluded: they bloat the repo, duplicate across every
# checkout, and change on every rerun anyway. See SKILL.md "Version control".

# Compiled binaries / build products
bin/*
!bin/.gitkeep

# Computational results — regenerated by driver scripts, not hand-edited.
# Keep the lab notebook itself tracked.
results/*/
!results/notebook.md

# Common generated/temp file patterns
*.tmp
*.log
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Large or dynamic raw data: uncomment if this project's data/ shouldn't be tracked at all.
# Small, genuinely static data files are a reasonable exception (see SKILL.md).
# data/*
# !data/*/README.md
